      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://hamiltontownshipmi.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic Hamilton Township Hall rents year‑round for $200, with a $125 refund if left in good order.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://hamiltontownshipmi.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "From April to October, the larger Hamilton Grange Hall rents for $400, returning $200 after a clean event.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
